# 1. Record architecture decisions

Status: accepted

## Context

People who join [[.Name]] later need to know why it is built the way it is, not only how.

## Decision

Significant decisions are recorded as short numbered files in this directory, each with context, the decision and its consequences. A decision is never edited after it is accepted; a new record supersedes it.

## Consequences

Reviewers can ask for a record when a pull request makes a choice that is expensive to reverse.
